rooms_desc ({"This room has a bar with a bar light.  It has a beautiful circular couch.A lazy boy recliner that is right next to the couch, and an endtable with a lamp.The lamp is by tiffany, and the endtable is made of redwood.There is a big-screen T.V. in the corner of the room.Next to the T.V. is an entertainment center with a cd player.There is also a vast selection of current chart-topping hits in the cd rack next to that.In one of the entertainment centers shelves is a container of queen cds, kansas, enya, clannad and the doore.Atop the T.V. is a container of great movies.Some of these movies feature Chistopher Lambert.","This room has a huge teloscope that seems larger than life.The telescope protrudes out of domed ceiling.The telescope has been used in the past to spy on her closest of enemies.However, it can be used for stargazing as well.","This room is covered from wall to wall with pillows and padding.There are also many soft blankets and silk sheets all over the for your enjoyment.In one of the corners is a table filled with wine and aphrodisiacs.The table is made of crystal.","This is the patio, where all your worries can be soaked away.There is a big Hot Tub in the middle of the patio.The jets of water in the Tub massage your worries away.This is also Guenhywyven's most favorite place to seduce visitors.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","In the middle of the room sits a golden throne encrusted with jewels.This Throne has very soft and velvety cushions.This room is where she takes care of her important business matters.Beware as she will kill those who sit in her chair!","This room is where Guenhywyven and her allies plan their war tactics.Especially those that have lyed to her in the past.There is an oval table in the center of the room.The table is surrounded by five chairs with comfortable cushions.",0,0,0,})
